OL,3,AWater queues build as 8,500 still
OL,4,Awithout supply
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of properties across
OL,7,FStourbridge, in the West Midlands,
OL,8,Fremain without water on Wednesday as
OL,9,Fengineers work to locate a burst pipe,
OL,10,Fwith repairs potentially taking until
OL,11,Fthe weekend.
OL,13,FRidgewood High School and Ashwood Park
OL,14,FPrimary School remained closed, and
OL,15,Fresidents said they had been unable to
OL,16,Fcook, wash or flush their toilets.
OL,18,FEmergency bottled water stations have
OL,19,Fbeen operating since 08:00 GMT,
OL,20,Falthough supplies temporarily ran out
OL,21,Fat one site before a fresh delivery was
OL,22,Farranged.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
